    text en official """In the case of an eligible individual with: / The credit percentage is: /  | 1 qualifying child / 34 / 15.98 | 2 qualifying children / 40 / 21.06 | 3 or more qualifying children / 45 / 21.06 | No qualifying children / 7.65 / 7.65""";
