    text en official """If vehicle inertia weight class is: / The 2002 model year city fuel economy is: | 1,500 or 1,750 lbs / 45.2 mpg | 2,000 lbs / 39.6 mpg | 2,250 lbs / 35.2 mpg | 2,500 lbs / 31.7 mpg | 2,750 lbs / 28.8 mpg | 3,000 lbs / 26.4 mpg | 3,500 lbs / 22.6 mpg | 4,000 lbs / 19.8 mpg | 4,500 lbs / 17.6 mpg | 5,000 lbs / 15.9 mpg | 5,500 lbs / 14.4 mpg | 6,000 lbs / 13.2 mpg | 6,500 lbs / 12.2 mpg | 7,000 to 8,500 lbs / 11.3 mpg.""";
